# Machine-specific Configuration

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` and fill in your paths.

## Environment
- Conda env: `<your-conda-env-name>`

## Paths
- Setup script: `<path-to-setup.sh>`
- PTOAS repo: `<path-to-PTOAS-repo>/`
- PTO ISA repo: `<path-to-pto-isa-repo>/`
- LLVM MLIR: `<path-to-llvm-project>/`
  - MLIR source: `mlir/`
  - Python bindings: `build-shared/tools/mlir/python_packages/mlir_core/mlir`
- Temp dir: `<path-to-temp-dir>/`
